@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Field guide";
}

<article class="field-guide shell" aria-labelledby="field-guide-title">
    <header class="article-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Northstar field guide · 08 min read</p>
        <h1 id="field-guide-title">How to find your way through the fog.</h1>
        <p class="lede">A practical set of prompts for making the next useful move when the whole map is still changing.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="article-layout">
        <nav rw-page-nav class="page-nav article-nav" aria-label="Field guide sections">
            <p class="eyebrow">In this guide</p>
            <a rw-page-nav-link href="#name-the-weather">Name the weather</a>
            <a rw-page-nav-link href="#choose-a-bearing">Choose a bearing</a>
            <a rw-page-nav-link href="#take-the-step">Take the step</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="article-copy">
            <img class="field-guide-image" src="~/images/northstar-field-guide.svg" alt="Northstar field guide cover." width="220" height="165">
            <section id="name-the-weather">
                <p class="eyebrow">01</p>
                <h2>Name the weather.</h2>
                <p>Before you solve a problem, describe the conditions around it. What changed? What feels heavier than it should? What are people already doing to compensate?</p>
            </section>
            <section id="choose-a-bearing">
                <p class="eyebrow">02</p>
                <h2>Choose a bearing.</h2>
                <p>A bearing is smaller than a destination. Pick the direction that makes the next decision easier, and let the work teach you what the farther horizon looks like.</p>
            </section>
            <section id="take-the-step">
                <p class="eyebrow">03</p>
                <h2>Take the step.</h2>
                <p>Make one thing real enough to react to. A draft, a conversation, a prototype, a sentence on a page. Momentum is often just contact with reality.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</article>

@section Scripts {
    <rw:scripts page-navigation="true" />
}
